                <mxCell id="c288" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#107C41&quot;&gt;DATA RULES&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9.5px&quot;&gt;• single writer: Logic App service login (SELECT/UPDATE parents + OnboardingApproval · INSERT audit)&lt;br&gt;• child rows replaced atomically on every upsert — no orphan state&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CorrelationId&lt;/b&gt; is the grouping key across the 3 unrelated natural keys AND the new OnboardingApproval table&lt;br&gt;• parents store the full GitHub publish metadata → the whole orchestrator payload is rebuildable from SQL alone&lt;br&gt;• EncryptedPassword: written via API, never returned by any read path&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Direction&lt;/b&gt; default &#39;Outbound&#39; preserves today&#39;s chase-loop behavior for every existing/future row unless explicitly Inbound&lt;br&gt;• EnrichmentStatus + DeploymentStatus + (new) ArchitectureApprovalStatus + BranchApprovalStatus together drive the portal, the launch gate, and the async-resume poller&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#107C41;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2A37;whiteSpace=wrap;shadow=1;" parent="lld-1" vertex="1">
